  <History Date="04-12-07" Author="Ion Balan" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="04-12-07" Author="Ion Balan" Comment="Checked" />
  <History Date="02-02-09" Author="D4 Personality Fixer 2009" Comment="Changed Function Names" />
  <History Date="28-05-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Corrected Colour Channel Problems" />
  <History Date="15-03-10" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Edited Pan locate values to 50% in line with CP documentation." />
  <History Date="14-01-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Added Physical PT information." />
  <History Date="17-05-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Edited Fixed Colour wheel to locate at DMX 0." />
  <History Date="19-04-12" Author="Locate Fix" Comment="Updated locate, power on, highlight and lowlight values to valid values" />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="29-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Temporarily changed Atlabase ID's for rain off modes to use rain on (previously were RGB)." />
  <History Date="29-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised conditionals.  Fixed duplicate functions in else conditions.  Added function index." />
  <History Date="29-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised colour index options.  Shortened colour function names to fit in displays." />
  <History Date="29-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased wheel resolution.  Revised speed controls.  Recreated palettes.  Standardised shutter." />
  <History Date="29-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed dimmer clear values.  Revised mode names to reflect settings more clearly." />
  <History Date="31-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised Atlbase ID's for rain off modes." />
  <History Date="06-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added gobo swatches (no slot numbers - guessed).  Added channel counts to mode names." />
  <Manual Filename="" Summary="" />
